[00:00.00] 作曲 : Jordan Fletcher
[00:11.53] Didn't take long, just a drink and a song
[00:11.53] 不过一杯酒 一首歌的时间
[00:14.63] Ain't it kinda funny how it happens that way?
[00:14.63] 这般相遇是否太过戏剧化？
[00:17.65] Knew it wasn't right but it didn't feel wrong
[00:17.65] 明知不该却难抵心动瞬间
[00:20.58] But when you're twenty-two, who cares anyway?
[00:20.58] 二十二岁的年华何须顾虑真假
[00:24.48] Ooh, just another cliché
[00:24.48] 唏嘘 又一段老套情节
[00:30.52] Ooh, always ridin' away
[00:30.52] 叹息 总是策马远去不见
[00:35.75]
[00:35.80] Cowboys run, chasin' that sun
[00:35.80] 牛仔追逐落日永不停歇
[00:38.71] She learned real young how to love and let go
[00:38.71] 她早学会爱人如指尖流沙
[00:41.76] 'Cause every single time she fell for green eyes
[00:41.76] 每次沦陷于碧绿眼眸深潭
[00:45.06] Every single promise was a pony show
[00:45.06] 所有承诺终成镜花水月
[00:48.00] Pieces of her heart that she can't get back
[00:48.00] 心碎残片散落荒野难拾捡
[00:50.78] In the back of a bronco drivin' too fast
[00:50.78] 飞驰的烈马后座颠簸岁月
[00:54.52] Yeah, the well ran dry
[00:54.52] 情泉已枯竭
[00:56.04] So there ain't no wonderin' why
[00:56.04] 何必追问缘由深浅
[00:58.71] That cowgirl don't cry
